  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Capture path",
      "items": [
        "Validate UUID, check the endpoint exists, then stream the body (413 above MAX_BODY_BYTES)",
        "Classify json / form / multipart / html / xml / text / binary; files are never stored",
        "Always answer 200 {ok, id} with CORS *; at most 500 rows per endpoint"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Real time without WebSocket",
      "items": [
        "Passenger on Apache has no WebSocket upgrade: Socket.IO runs on HTTP long-polling",
        "Several app processes: the capturing process emits in memory, ChangeDetector polls the DB for the others",
        "Clients dedupe by id and fall back to REST polling every 5 s when the socket is down"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Shared code",
      "items": [
        "packages/shared: DTOs, Socket.IO event maps and the endpoint id rule used by API and web",
        "Retention is computed, never stored: expires_at = received_at + settings.retention_days"
      ]
    }
  ]
